      "body": "## Purpose\n\nDeclare and refresh the FP32 head-gate projection mirror and merged Q/K/V convolution buffers. Cold/lazy processing and post_weights_reload share refresh logic. Repeated layerwise reload coverage checks values and stable allocations after child weights are restored.\n\nTracks #57895.\n\n## Merge order\n\nMerge #53509 first. This branch starts directly from main and contains only its own change, with no prerequisite PR commits. It is not stacked. Rebase onto main after the prerequisite merges before integration CI. The full recommended sequence is in #57895.\n\n## Validation\n\nLocal Ruff lint/format, Python compilation, diff checks, test-tether checks, and sign-off auditing passed. Linux/backend runtime and graph replay remain pending. Windows pytest collection is blocked by missing uvloop. No H20 or other remote GPU validation was run.\n\n## AI assistance\n\nCode and PR text prepared with AI assistance. Human review and runtime validation remain pending.",
